{"translation":{"id":"aii_abt","name":"ܕܝܬܩܐ ܚܕܬܐ ܕܡܪܢ ܝܫܘܥ ܡܫܝܚܐ ܘܡܙܡܘܪ̈ܐ ܒܠܫܢܐ ܐܬܘܪܝܐ","website":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=aii","licenseUrl":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=aii","licenseNotes":null,"shortName":"ABT","englishName":"Assyrian Neo-Aramaic NT+Psalms","language":"aii","textDirection":"rtl","sha256":"1859152dbbffe55d2b7ac6d4c09fbad5a6416ca25359e69220bb358dac602444","availableFormats":["json"],"listOfBooksApiLink":"/api/aii_abt/books.json","numberOfBooks":28,"totalNumberOfChapters":410,"totalNumberOfVerses":10420,"languageName":"Assyrian Neo-Aramaic","languageEnglishName":"Assyrian Neo-Aramaic"},"book":{"id":"PSA","translationId":"aii_abt","name":"ܡܙܡܘܪ̈ܐ","commonName":"ܡܙܡܘܪ̈ܐ","title":"ܡܙܡܘܪ̈ܐ","order":19,"numberOfChapters":150,"sha256":"08b7c4463dda6adc56b2c377f42d67ace350af655720940a2e395776a718fc6c","firstChapterNumber":1,"firstChapterApiLink":"/api/aii_abt/PSA/1.json","lastChapterNumber":150,"lastChapterApiLink":"/api/aii_abt/PSA/150.json","totalNumberOfVerses":2461},"chapter":{"number":28,"content":[{"type":"heading","content":["ܡܙܡܘܪܐ ܕܕܘܝܕ."]},{"type":"verse","number":1,"content":[{"text":"ܐܸܠܘܼܟ݂، ܝܵܐ ܡܵܪܝܵܐ، ܟܹܐ ܩܵܪܹܝܢ،","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"ܝܵܐ ܐܝܼܨܵܪܝܼ، ܠܵܐ ܐܵܟ̰ܡܹܬ ܢܵܬܘܼܟ݂ ܥܲܠܝܼ. ܠܵܐ ܗܵܘܹܐ ܕܫܵܬܩܹܬ ܥܲܠܝܼ،","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"ܘܕܵܡܹܝܢ ܠܨܵܠܝܵܢܹ̈ܐ ܕܓܘܼܒܵܐ.","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":2,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"ܫܡܹܥ ܩܵܠܵܐ ܕܦܲܪܦܲܠܬ‌ܝܼ ܒܓܥܵܝܬ‌ܝܼ ܐܸܠܘܼܟ݂،","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"ܒܡܲܪܲܡܬܵ‌ܐ ܕܐܝܼܕܵܬ‌ܝܼ̈ ܠܗܲܝܟܠܵܐ ܕܩܘܼܕܫܘܼܟ݂.","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":3,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"ܠܵܐ ܓܵܪܫܹܬ ܠܝܼ ܥܲܡ ܪ̈ܲܫܝܼܥܹܐ،","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"ܘܥܲܡ ܦܵܠܚܵܢܹ̈ܐ ܕܥܵܘܠܵܐ، ܕܟܹܐ ܗܲܡܙܸܡܝܼ ܫܠܵܡܵܐ ܥܲܡ ܚܲܒ݂ܪ̈ܵܘܵܬܵܝܗ‌ܝ،","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"ܟܲܕ ܒܝܼܫܬܵ‌ܐ ܒܠܸܒܵܝܗ‌ܝ.","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":4,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"ܦܪܹܥ ܠܗܘܿܢ ܐܲܝܟ݂ ܦܘܼܠܚܵܢܵܝܗ‌ܝ، ܘܐܲܝܟ݂ ܒܝܼܫܘܼܬܵ‌ܐ ܕܣܘܼܥܪ̈ܵܢܵܝܗ‌ܝ،","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"ܐܲܝܟ݂ ܥܒ݂ܵܕܵܐ ܕܐܝܼܕܵܬܵܝ̈ܗ‌ܝ ܦܪܹܥ ܠܗܘܿܢ،","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"ܡܲܕܸܪ ܦܘܼܪܥܵܢܵܝܗ‌ܝ ܥܲܠܵܝܗ‌ܝ.","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":5,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"ܒܗ̇ܝ ܕܠܹܐ ܦܲܪܡܝܼ ܠܦܘܼܠܚܵܢܹ̈ܐ ܕܡܵܪܝܵܐ،","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"ܐܵܦܠܵܐ ܠܥܒ݂ܵܕܵܐ ܕܐܝܼܕܵܬܘܼ̈ܗ‌ܝ،","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"ܒܸܬ ܬܲܠܸܚ ܠܗܘܿܢ ܘܠܹܐ ܒܵܢܹܐ ܠܗܘܿܢ.","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":6,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"ܒܪܝܼܟ݂ܵܐ ܝܠܹܗ ܡܵܪܝܵܐ،","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"ܒܗ̇ܝ ܕܫܡܝܼܥ ܠܹܗ ܩܵܠܵܐ ܕܦܲܪܦܲܠܬ‌ܝܼ.","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":7,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"ܡܵܪܝܵܐ ܝܠܹܗ ܥܘܼܫܢܝܼ ܘܡܵܛܵܠܝܼ،","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"ܒܝܼܹܗ ܣܒܝܼܪܹܗ ܠܸܒܝܼ، ܘܦܝܼܫ ܠܝܼ ܗܘܼܝܸܪܵܐ؛","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"ܒܘܼܬ ܐܵܗܵܐ، ܦܨܝܼܚ ܠܹܗ ܠܸܒܝܼ، ܘܒܙܡܵܪܬ‌ܝܼ ܒܸܬ ܫܲܟܪܸܢܹܗ.","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":8,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"ܡܵܪܝܵܐ ܝܠܹܗ ܥܘܼܫܢܵܐ ܠܥܲܡܹܗ،","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"ܘܩܲܠܥܵܐ ܕܦܘܼܪܩܵܢܵܐ ܕܡܫܝܼܚܹܗ.","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":9,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"ܦܲܪܸܩ ܠܥܲܡܘܼܟ݂، ܘܒܲܪܸܟ݂ ܠܝܵܪܬܘܼܬܘܼܟ݂،","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"ܘܡܲܪܥܝܼ ܠܗܘܿܢ، ܘܛܥܘܿܢ ܠܗܘܿܢ ܥܲܠܔ ܕܪ̈ܵܥܢܵܢܘܼܟ݂ ܗܲܠܔ ܥܵܠܲܡ.","poem":1}]}],"footnotes":[]},"thisChapterLink":"/api/aii_abt/PSA/28.json","thisChapterAudioLinks":{},"nextChapterApiLink":"/api/aii_abt/PSA/29.json","nextChapterAudioLinks":{},"previousChapterApiLink":"/api/aii_abt/PSA/27.json","previousChapterAudioLinks":{},"numberOfVerses":9}